  "description": "The story begins when a character from an old console game decides to set out in search of their lover before the console reaches the end of its life. Yuseong steps out into the human world for the first time to find the lover with whom they once lived inside the console; after reuniting with their lover, they finally escape the world of the game... But will the two of them, now reunited, be able to live together in human form in the human world?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Bomtoon](https://bomtoon.com/detail/jak_sa), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/jak_sa)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/jak_sa)",
